      <p class="_abstract">Compare default and custom ingress certificate workflows in OpenShift Container Platform and how cluster components trust Operator serving certificates.</p>
      <h3 id="ingress-certificates-workflow-custom_cert-types-ingress-certificates" class="group scroll-mt-20">Custom certificate workflow<a href="#ingress-certificates-workflow-custom_cert-types-ingress-certificates" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
