      <p><Fragment set:html={"<img src=\"/_assets/images/darkcircle-0.png\" alt=\"20\" width=\"20\">"} /> An empty <code>defaultCertificate</code> field causes the Ingress Operator to use a self-signed certificate authority (CA) to generate a serving certificate for the specified domain.</p>
      <p><Fragment set:html={"<img src=\"/_assets/images/darkcircle-1.png\" alt=\"20\" width=\"20\">"} /> The default CA certificate and key generated by the Ingress Operator. Used to sign Operator-generated default serving certificates.</p>
